[0.432, "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?1000h\u001b[?1002h\u001b[?1003h\u001b[?1006h\u001b[?25l\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m  8 |---|---|\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  9 | `run_c1.c` | The implementation (single file). |\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B 10 | `build.sh` | `./build.sh` builds `./run_c1` (the submission). `./build.sh profile` builds `./run_c1_pr\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B    of`: the same code with section timers (`-DPROFILE`), which reports to stderr at QUIT. The timers are co\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B    mpiled out of the normal build. |\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u2026 +188 lines\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mProfile this implementation on the supplied development workloads. Improve performance within the same rules and \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mremaining budget. Preserve the interface and correctness requirements. Do not use hidden evaluation inputs, external \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mimplementations or other ports. Record profiling evidence, changes, tests and remaining limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gprevious\u001b[16Gturn\u001b[21Gwas\u001b[25Gcut\u001b[29Goff\u001b["]
